&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As we scale the rollout of Open Intelligence across global markets, we are looking for a Data Operations &amp;amp; Enablement Manager to help operationalize the platform and support markets as they onboard data and adopt new capabilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
