&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML, part of WPP, is a leading creative company that combines brand experience, customer experience, and commerce, creating connected brands to drive growth. VML is celebrated for its innovative and human first, award-winning work for blue chip client partners including AstraZeneca, Colgate-Palmolive, Dell, Ford, Microsoft, Nestlé, The Coca-Cola Company, and Wendy&#39;s. The agency is recognized by the Forrester Wave™ Reports, as a Leader among Marketing Creative and Content Service Providers, Commerce Services, Global Digital Experience Services, Global Marketing Services and, most recently, Marketing Measurement &amp;amp; Optimization. In addition, VML’s specialist health network, VML Health, is one of the world’s largest and most awarded health agencies. VML’s global network is powered by 26,000 talented people across 55+ markets, with principal offices in Kansas City, New York, Detroit, London, São Paulo, Shanghai, Singapore, and Sydney.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel&amp;nbsp;in a single company –&amp;nbsp;powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open,&amp;nbsp;to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://wpp.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;2714312b-312f-4651-9f88-d8a4e47547bc&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Senior Consultant with experience in Commerce ecosystems and technologies wanted to join our Business Services team on a &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Fixed Term Contract basis&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;The opportunity:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are on the hunt for a visionary and accomplished Senior Business Consultant to play a pivotal role in shaping the future of our Consultancy solutions .&amp;nbsp;This is not merely a high profile role; it&#39;s an opportunity to act as a trusted leader and mentor, guiding both our clients and our internal team towards unprecedented success. Your deep industry expertise and collaborative leadership style will be instrumental in driving impactful business outcomes, while your commitment to our people-first approach will be essential in fostering a culture of empowerment, growth, and continuous improvement within the Consultancy team and across the entire Business Services department.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Please note this is a 12 month FTC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;London - Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Other core elements of this role will be:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading teams of cross functional skill sets to work together to create coherent answers to client questions, through high-quality outputs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about understanding and solving complex problems for our clients within an ever-changing digital landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Listening to client challenges and using client knowledge to spot opportunities for other ways we can help the client outside of the core engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Using advance communication skills to unpick client problems rapidly, getting to the core of how we can support, often in situations that lack clarity&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll be doing:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will have a strong consultancy background or acted as a Senior Business Leader with in-depth specialist sector knowledge across a minimum of 1-2 areas (ideal sectors include retail, FMCG/CPG, B2B, automotive)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Key responsibilities:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Client Engagement &amp;amp; Relationship Management:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional engagements, serving as the primary point of contact for senior client stakeholders in some of our largest clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and nurture strong, trusted relationships with clients, understanding their business challenges and objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify and pursue opportunities to expand existing client relationships and generate new business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Development:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, mentor, and coach the more junior consultants, fostering a collaborative and high-performing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inspire and empower team members to take ownership, develop their skills, and reach their full potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote knowledge sharing and best practices across the team and wider organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic Consulting &amp;amp; Solution Delivery:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage your expertise in e-Commerce and specialist sector knowledge (e.g., retail, FMCG/CPG, B2B, automotive) to provide strategic guidance and solutions to clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident communicator who can articulately ask questions and actively listen in order to get to the core of the client problem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being comfortable with ‘grey’, bringing clarity to ambiguous situations and utilising your advanced problem-solving capability to quickly analyse complex business problems and independently overcome obstacles. A lateral thinking who is able to step back to assess the client ask from a broader perspective&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct thorough business analysis, identifying pain points, opportunities, and areas for improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A deep understanding of technologies that form a part of digital ecosystems, such as ecommerce platforms like Salesforce Commerce Cloud, CMS, PIM etc. as well as software delivery methodology including agile&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and present compelling proposals, roadmaps, and presentations that clearly articulate value propositions and solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the delivery function with business insights to help keep the business &amp;amp; team focussed on outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous Improvement &amp;amp; Innovation:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify and implement process improvements to enhance team efficiency, output quality, and client satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay abreast of industry trends, emerging technologies, and best practices, incorporating relevant learnings into your work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the development and refinement of internal methodologies, frameworks, and tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we want from you:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience in management or consultancy roles within the e-Commerce domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-depth specialist sector knowledge in at least 1-2 areas, ideally including retail, FMCG/CPG, B2B, or automotive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of digital ecosystems and technologies, including e-commerce platforms, CMS, PIM, and agile software delivery methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven leadership skills with the ability to effectively lead and motivate cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional relationship-building and networking skills, with a knack for building rapport with senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced problem-solving skills, with the ability to analyse complex business problems, think laterally, and develop creative solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and presentation skills, with the ability to articulate complex ideas clearly and concisely to both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for client success and a commitment to exceeding expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel to client sites within the UK and potentially within the EU.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we can offer you:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alongside the opportunity to work with some of the most exciting brands around the world, we’ll also prioritise your career development and help you grow your skills. We’ll empower you to make a difference, allow you to be yourself, and respect who you are.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Permanent only:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer a great benefits package including a discretionary bonus scheme, training opportunities, competitive pension, medical insurance, life assurance, social events, opportunities to buy and sell holidays, family friendly policies, discounts with hundreds of retailers and much more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our culture thrives on our core values, designed for impact-driven individuals: Heart, Brains and Courage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We lead with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Heart&lt;/strong&gt;, fostering empathy and trust where genuine connections and human-centric work flourish.&lt;br&gt;We empower your&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Brains&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;for innovation, valuing relentless curiosity and collaborative intelligence to solve complex challenges.&lt;br&gt;And we champion&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Courage&lt;/strong&gt;, inspiring you to speak up, embrace experimentation, and advocate for bold solutions that push our thinking to be better than yesterday.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-EMEA&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office an average of four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;WPP (VML) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;scxw176048299&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;scxw176048299&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;VML is a WPP agency (NYSE: WPP). For more information, please visit  &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.vml.com&lt;/a&gt;, and follow along on&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/vml_global/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/vml/&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/vml_global?lang=en&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click &quot;Submit Application&quot;, this will send any information you add below to VML. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML, part of WPP, is a leading creative company that combines brand experience, customer experience, and commerce, creating connected brands to drive growth. VML is celebrated for its innovative and human first, award-winning work for blue chip client partners including AstraZeneca, Colgate-Palmolive, Dell, Ford, Microsoft, Nestlé, The Coca-Cola Company, and Wendy&#39;s. The agency is recognized by the Forrester Wave™ Reports, as a Leader among Marketing Creative and Content Service Providers, Commerce Services, Global Digital Experience Services, Global Marketing Services and, most recently, Marketing Measurement &amp;amp; Optimization. In addition, VML’s specialist health network, VML Health, is one of the world’s largest and most awarded health agencies. VML’s global network is powered by 26,000 talented people across 55+ markets, with principal offices in Kansas City, New York, Detroit, London, São Paulo, Shanghai, Singapore, and Sydney.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel&amp;nbsp;in a single company –&amp;nbsp;powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open,&amp;nbsp;to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://wpp.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;2714312b-312f-4651-9f88-d8a4e47547bc&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Senior Client Success Director with deep expertise in Marketing effectiveness and econometrics to lead our most strategic client relationships and shape the future of our client success function. In this senior leadership role, you will serve as a trusted advisor to C-suite executives, ensuring our advanced analytics solutions deliver measurable business outcomes while driving account growth and retention.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Client Success Senior Director will be responsible for client leadership across a selection of Gain Theory’s portfolio. The ideal candidate should have a minimum of 8 years of experience in client relationship management and data analytics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We expect this person to be the primary point of contact for senior client stakeholders and to act as a trusted advisor, deeply understanding client business objectives and leveraging Gain Theory’s expertise to deliver exceptional value and drive measurable results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We require someone who has a deep understanding of data and analytics, is able to interpret complex datasets and extract actionable insights that drive client success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This person should serve as an inspirational leader within the Client Success team, fostering a collaborative and results-oriented environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Project Delivery:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensures projects within remit are managed to time and scope. Highlights any risks to client lead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Puts in place robust quality assurance techniques and follows them to ensure work going to clients is right first time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uses data and analytics interpretation skills to bring insights to life for a mid-senior audience (i.e. most senior day-to-day client stakeholder)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is a strong data storyteller who can explain complex insights at a simple, impactful level to a variety of audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensures clients have full knowledge and training of Gain Theory Interactive, highlighting any bugs or enhancements to the GTI team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensures projects are following Operational Excellence process and that there is full adherence from Client Success team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Financial:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;​Looks for opportunities to drive profitable growth for clients and take on incremental (e.g. 1-30% growth) opportunities. Bring in client lead and senior team for larger opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifies values driven for clients and looks to assist clients in recognising that value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understands how decisions made on projects will impact profitability and looks to run more efficient processes or tighter management of scope, designed in consultancy with client lead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understands how actions they take will impact overall Gain Theory profitability and looks to make the right decisions towards this at all times&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is involved in new business pitches as part of a wider team. May be expected to lead opportunities that do not need a large team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Client Management:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manages against SOW to ensure limited scope creep and slippages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implements plans to drive higher client satisfaction across every metric, highlighting any issues to client leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Helps to increase the number of stakeholders and advocacy at the right level (e.g. most senior day to day stakeholder). Works with client leadership to embed plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Works with client leadership on risk mitigation process, highlighting any risks early and working on plans to mitigate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Thought Leadership:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has sufficient knowledge of most of Gain Theory solutions, systems and ways of working to have a healthy conversation with a client in any aspect of Gain Theory&#39;s offering. Is actively looking to learn in this space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintains a solid understanding of their clients&#39; industries, keeping up to date with key trends and seeking opportunities for growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintains a good understanding of the marketing effectiveness industry, assessing for threats, challenges and opportunities that said industry presents to client relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Values &amp;amp; Team:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is an inspirational leader for Client Success Managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implements initiatives to improve Client Success team satisfaction within squad. Understands what drives employee satisfaction and looks to make things better for all.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitates collaborative learning and knowledge sharing to boost team capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPIs &amp;amp; Success Factors:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Net Sales Growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;# of Client Stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Client Influence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Client Advocacy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Client Satisfaction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Client Success Practice Area ESAT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;OPEX Implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Value generated for Clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awards entered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’d need to succeed:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in client success, consulting, or marketing analytics roles, with significant client-facing responsibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated expertise in Marketing Mix Modeling and econometrics (model interpretation, ROI analysis, elasticity, attribution methods).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead, manage, and develop high-performing Client Success teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success in managing enterprise portfolios and influencing C-suite stakeholders across global brands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to manage client relationships and communicate complex analytics to non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong strategic thinking and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial mindset with experience identifying new opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, presentation, and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven project management experience, with the ability to manage multiple projects simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled in tools such as Excel, PowerPoint, and at least one analytics environment (R, Python, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in a quantitative field (e.g., Statistics, Economics, Mathematics).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Why work for us?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
